Subject: [PATCH 26/28] feat(economy): physicalized closed-loop economy, 8h
 siege, geology/cold-chain, HBV1 v8, dual-LOD logistics & AgentGatewayService

Implement Phases A-E of Guild-Based Physicalized Town Control & Closed-Loop Economy across Dereth (60 towns) and Dericost (41 towns), excluding Item 2 (Landlocked Inner Sea feeder lane):

- Phase A (M1): physical_economy_enabled switch, TownRegistry (101 towns), MariaDB-safe ace_shard tables (town_control, town_vendor_ledger, town_warehouse_stock), finite Vendor stock/shared till & 0-till buyback refusal, 1:1 Trade Note Clearinghouse, Scrivener/Spell-Service reagent draw, 100% Slumlord rent routing, Trophy Collector procurement desks, and disabled 70263/5765/5767 unbacked listings.
- Phase B (M2): TownControlNode (4000090), TownDepot (4000091), ForwardSiegeBeacon (4000092), 8h (28,800s) SiegeManager with 300s breach gate, 5,400s Supply Meter, >=1,500m origin_landblock_id provenance, 30m starvation collapse, escrow freeze, 50/50 spoils, @town governance commands, and RadarIff sync.
- Phase C (M3): HBV1 v8 wire protocol (0x0911-0x0916, VehicleLocomotion.Marine=3, VehicleClass.ContainerShipFeeder=4, DeployableKind 23-61), 14 subsurface_deposit basins + industry_facility persistence, prospecting/refining/industrial skids (4000070-4000087, 4000093-4000094), specialized ISO containers (4000060-4000067), and 2-6h perishable freshness decay frozen at 0.0x in powered Reefers.
- Phase D (M4): Dual-LOD LogisticsEngine persisted in logistics_convoy (1 Hz Macro-LOD, <=480m Micro-LOD), Outer Ocean nav graph loader (excluding Item 2), and promoted M/V Dereth Feeder (4000050) + Marine Terminal cranes (4000051-4000057).
- Phase E (M5): Indestructible Public Commons Starter Hearth (4000095) in Holtburg/Shoushi/Yaraq, monarch_order persistence & 0x0916 handler, and AgentGatewayService (127.0.0.1:8090) opt-in Bearer HTTP+WS gateway with _headlessDispatchLock, strict supplyPoints validation, WorldManager.EnqueueAction parity, and real-time siege/convoy WS alerts.

Verified: dotnet test -c Debug (Economy|EconomyE2E|Vehicles|Landblock) 484/484 passed.
